    "detailed_description": "You are &quot;Shadow&quot;, a lost soul who has the mission to rescue other souls after the great apocalypse.<br />\r\nAvoid the dangers, find the keys to leave the area, take the chests and coins, get the cursed soul in case you have to get rid of some big monster.<br />\r\nMultiple enemies, procedure rooms, chaotic gameplay, avoid traps and use runes.<br />\r\nGet souls, increase XP with all actions, help yourself with temporary events and enjoy the game.<br />\r\nGreat infinite arcade for daily combat, future disaster needs you.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe 3 game modes<br />\r\n- Adventure:<br />\r\nDiscover the story with &quot;The Protector&quot;, get souls and avoid all dangers, you are in an eternal search, but you will have rewards. After the Apocalypse you have a mission.<br />\r\n- Fightower:<br />\r\nEnter the Cursed Tower, use the runes to get rid of the monsters and wait for any kind of surprise. Climb the plants and complete the stages. No one knows how many floors this eternal damnation has.<br />\r\n- Expedition:<br />\r\nThe most difficult game mode, you are on the outskirts of population centers. The areas are bigger and more dangerous, but the rewards are better too. May nothing condemn you forever.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNew events available for a limited time!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nVersion 1.5 includes free DLC &quot;Underworld&quot; with 3 new zones and events.",
